    "created_at": "2020-06-25T00:33:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-25T00:33:06Z",
    "body": "I agree, Webapps shouldn’t embed it today. https://github.com/sleevi/psl-problems lists several reasons. In the context of apps, they have zero guarantees that the copy they embed matches how the browser is processing things, and there’s zero guarantee across browsers.\r\n\r\nWhy are they embedding today?",
