    "created_at": "2025-05-29T20:24:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-29T20:59:00Z",
    "body": "Just wanted to +1 this.  Also, maybe relevant is this paper we published, where we found a lot of projects doing their own mishandling of the PSL (not only limited to sites and extensions, but also includes a lot of extensions and node applications).\n\nThis paper is mostly us finding lots of tools using very out of date lists (either because they bundle them and dont necessarily update them on first run, or they dont think to update them at runtime at all). It'd be nice for the platform / browser to just provide a correct version for them.\n\nhttps://www.peteresnyder.com/static/papers/public-suffix-list-imc-2023.pdf\n\nIm at Brave, and I expect we'd be happy to implement this addition in Chromium if there was interest from other browser vendors",
    "author_association": "NONE",
