    "updated_at": "2025-05-29T20:29:20Z",
    "body": "Design-wise, you'll need to decide if you want to expose the schemeful or schemeless site. https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#obtain-a-site is schemeful (and what I'd guess would be most useful), but the example in the OP shows only the registrable domain (so [schemeless](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#schemelessly-same-site)).",
