    "updated_at": "2025-05-29T20:51:05Z",
    "body": "I dont have a strong pref. I expect Brave would be fine implementing either approach, and either approach would prevent sites from needing to roll their own.  But, i think `schemeless` would be slightly nicer, since if you want the scheme, you can already easily get it with [`URL.protocol`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/URL/protocol).\n\nBut, super dont want to bikeshed things.  I think either option would be terrific, and happy to support either option",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
